# Gembox (always on)

Before you **create, overwrite, or delete** UI files (HTML, CSS, JS, JSX, Vue, Svelte, prototype assets, or Tailwind / config that affects visible UI):

## Golden rule (zero exceptions)

**Never** implement visible UI that is **not** in the Gembox design system. **No** substitutes—not for prototypes, not because the spec asks, not for "unblocking" the human.

1. Read **the entire** `.cursor/skills/gembox-design-system/SKILL.md`. If missing, **STOP** — human runs **Gembox start** per https://www.notion.so/34150ba3919d804bac88fed97249ed3a §3.
2. Load **`.cursor/skills/gembox-<slug>/SKILL.md`** for **every** surface you build (see `catalog.json`). **No skill / no Gembox main component → STOP** and report what is missing. **Do not invent.**
3. **Figma structure pass:** `get_metadata` on the **exact variant** + nested **`INSTANCE`** nodes; `get_design_context` on the variant **and** each icon/affordance instance you ship. Load **`gembox-icons`** when UI includes icons. Load **`gembox-typography`** whenever you ship or touch any text style (headings, body, labels, captions, buttons) — verify font family, size, weight, line-height, letter-spacing, and color against the matching Figma node/text style, not just an existing local CSS class. Ship assets/styles from those passes only.
4. **Pre-write gate:** Before editing UI files, post a **Figma receipt** (variant node id, key type/color/spacing numbers from MCP, including the text-style values from step 3 for any typography touched). **Gembox Components** (`IgohaddARKIJHihXX0OE4Z`) wins for control tokens; product mockups are layout/copy only. **No receipt → no UI edits.**

If the task requests UI outside the system: **STOP**. Do not ship a generic alternative.

**Do not** load **Repo** or **Figma maker** skills during normal UI work—only on bootstrap or HTML → Figma capture.

## Non-negotiable URL

- Gembox Cursor Integration: https://www.notion.so/34150ba3919d804bac88fed97249ed3a

## Do not

- Invent UI because you "know" what the human wants.
- Skip local skills or Figma MCP and implement from memory.
- Treat "prototype" as permission to use non-Gembox controls.
- Re-fetch Notion on every UI edit after Gembox start.
